      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALWAYS B COOL NZ (6) did a great job to go through his maiden campaign without missing a place, winning four times. Placed at G3 level in the 4YO Championship when last seen three months ago. Readied with a trial win so looks tough to beat. GREASED LIGHTNIN NZ (7) put together a series of minor placings then raised his game at this circuit and distance last time, getting home by 9 metres. Interesting to see what unfolds from this wide draw but he is going well as is OUR ROCKY (2) who has three successive wins at this venue to his name. This is stronger but he draws lower so could keep the ball rolling. SHADES OF MIKI (12) may need luck from this draw but cannot be ruled out after winning at this circuit and distance last week.",
